          "review": [{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Harshita"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The Rizta S is the no-nonsense choice. It gives you the long range and safety technology without the expensive features that many family riders don't need. Highly practical and smart purchase.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Pooja"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The Crash Alert feature, which notifies loved ones in case of an accident, is an essential safety feature for a vehicle used by the entire family. Ather prioritized real-world security.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Kiran"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The exclusion of the TFT touchscreen of the Z variant is the main compromise here, meaning no document storage or WhatsApp preview on the dash. It's a trade-off for the lower price and high range.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.1,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Zoya"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The availability of the 8-year/80,000 km battery warranty extension is the ultimate security blanket. It proves Ather stands behind the battery longevity, securing the car's value for years.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.6,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Deepak Taneja"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The 3.7 kWh battery is the main reason to choose this model. It provides peace of mind that even in 'Zip' mode, the real-world range will still exceed 100 km comfortably.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Manish"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The scooter is stylish and retains Ather’s premium look, despite being family-focused. The mono-tone colours look elegant, a great blend of form and family function.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Ritu"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"I'm disappointed that this trim skips the Magic Twist™ regenerative braking and the rear disc brake (only disc/drum on S trim). I'd pay extra for the rear disc brake for better wet-weather stopping power.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Vijay"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The suspension is tuned for comfort, doing a great job of absorbing small bumps and rough city roads. The gentle performance and stable handling make for a very relaxed ride.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Neha Singh"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The price tag (around ₹1.37 Lakh ex-showroom) is very competitive for a long-range Ather. It’s an investment in reliability and safety, which is always worth it.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Gaurav"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The charging is fast enough for the large battery. 4 hours 30 minutes for 0-80% is efficient. Plus, access to the widespread Ather Grid fast-charging network is a massive advantage over competitors.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sanjana"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"I appreciate the balance of tech. It retains the core safety features like AutoHold™ on slopes and FallSafe™, but the DeepView LCD display is simpler and reduces the distraction of a full touchscreen.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Anil"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"Performance is more than adequate. 80 km/hr top speed is safe for city roads, and the smooth power delivery (0-40 km/h in 4.7s) is gentle enough for senior citizens and new riders.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.9,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Pooja"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The practicality is unmatched. The 34L under-seat storage is massive, and the optional 22L Frunk means I can finally fit all my groceries and belongings securely. Practicality over performance wins here.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Karan Malhotra"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"The longest seat in the segment is a huge win. My wife and two children fit comfortably for short school runs. It’s definitely a true family scooter, unlike the sporty 450X.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3.1,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Dr. Riya Sharma"},"datePublished":"2025-10-25","reviewBody":"This variant is perfect for my family's needs. It gives the full 159 km certified range with the big 3.7 kWh battery, which is crucial for my long city commute, while saving money over the top-end Z model.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"shriram"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather Rizta is a friendly scooter with great value for money. It offers a comfortable ride and meets most customer requirements, though some may find it bulky.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"sapna kumari"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Rizta is a great scooter for daily city commutes. The storage capacity is huge, and Ather's connectivity features are excellent. The ride quality is also good, even on rough roads.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"gita lata"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I'm proud to own the Ather Rizta. It's an amazing scooter with a futuristic design and comfortable ride. The only drawback is the limited range and lack of advanced features.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"saraj deen"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather Rizta is a great option for city rides, offering a smooth ride and good performance. However, the charging time is a bit long.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"rukmani"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've enjoyed riding the Rizta for its agility and comfort. However, the after-sales service experience could be better.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"bhagirath"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Rizta is a good scooter, but it lacks in terms of practicality for heavier riders and those seeking more advanced features.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"balbir"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather Rizta offers a fantastic riding experience with its smooth ride and good performance. However, the limited range and charging infrastructure are drawbacks.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"balkrishnan"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been impressed with the Rizta's range and handling. It's agile and fun to ride, though the service experience could be improved.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.7,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"arnab paul"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Rizta is a great option for those seeking an eco-friendly scooter. It's fun to ride, but the lack of advanced features is noticeable compared to other models.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"ajay yadav"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I love the Rizta for its futuristic design and comfortable ride. It's a great value for money, though the charging time could be faster.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"abhishek kumar"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather Rizta is a solid choice for city rides. It offers a smooth ride and good performance, though the price is a bit steep for some buyers.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"abdur rahman"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've had mixed experiences with the Rizta. While it's efficient and eco-friendly, there have been some issues with charging infrastructure and limited range.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"amar"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been impressed with the Rizta's handling and features. It's agile and fun to ride, though the weight can be a bit much for some riders.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"july parween"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Rizta is a great scooter for daily commutes. It offers a comfortable ride and good performance, though the range could be better for longer trips.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"kesi reddy"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been using the Ather Rizta for a month now, and it's been a fantastic experience. The ride quality is excellent, and the design is sleek. However, the charging time is a bit long.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":"5"}}]

